# cek_senet.func

> Module: cek_senet (Çek / Senet Takibi) | Category: FINANCE

## Purpose
Post-dated check (çek) and promissory note (senet) tracking. A critical financial instrument in Turkish business culture where B2B payments commonly use post-dated checks. The most complex frontend module at 947 lines.

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish businesses extensively use post-dated checks for B2B payments
- Fleet owners need to track incoming/outgoing checks with maturity dates
- Portfolio view: total value by status (pending, collected, bounced)
- Bank coordination: which bank, branch, account the check is drawn on
- Legal compliance: Çek Kanunu (Check Law) requirements for bounced checks
- Cash flow forecasting based on check maturity dates

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `cek_senet`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| tur | cek_senet_tur_enum | CEK (check) / SENET (promissory note) |
| borclu | VARCHAR(200) | Debtor name |
| alacakli | VARCHAR(200) | Creditor name |
| banka | VARCHAR(100) | Bank name |
| sube | VARCHAR(100) | Branch |
| hesap_no | VARCHAR(50) | Account number |
| cek_no | VARCHAR(50) | Check number |
| tutar | DECIMAL(12,2) | Amount |
| vade_tarihi | DATE | Maturity date |
| keside_tarihi | DATE | Issue date |
| durum | cek_senet_durum_enum | Status |
| musteri_id | INTEGER FK | Linked customer |
| aciklama | TEXT | Notes |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Enums:**
- `cek_senet_tur_enum`: CEK, SENET
- `cek_senet_durum_enum`: BEKLIYOR, TAHSIL_EDILDI, KARSILIKSIZ, IPTAL, TEMINATTA

## User Interface
**CekSenetPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/cek-senet` (947 lines)
- **KPI Dashboard cards:** Toplam Çek/Senet, Bekleyen Tutar, Tahsil Edilen, Karşılıksız
- DataGrid table: Tür, Borçlu, Banka, Çek No, Tutar, Vade, Durum, Müşteri
- Status badges: green (collected), yellow (pending), red (bounced), gray (cancelled)
- Add/Edit modal: type selector, debtor, bank, amount, dates, customer selector
- Status update: dropdown to change status with confirmation
- Portfolio summary: totals by status
- Quick customer creation from within the modal
- Bulk operations
- Export to CSV/Excel/PDF

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/cek-senet/` | Tenant JWT | List checks/notes |
| GET | `/api/tenant/cek-senet/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Single record |
| GET | `/api/tenant/cek-senet/summary` | Tenant JWT | Portfolio summary |
| POST | `/api/tenant/cek-senet/` | Tenant JWT | Create |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/cek-senet/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/cek-senet/{id}/status` | Tenant JWT | Update status |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/cek-senet/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove |

